@startuml G-政民互动
' 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 L3 · G 政民互动（UC-SUB-G-01 ~ G-03）
title 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 · G 政民互动
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "消费者" as CONSUMER
actor "政府" as GOV
actor "监管人员" as REGU

rectangle "G 政民互动" {
  usecase "UC-SUB-G-01 提交并承办群众诉求" as G01
  usecase "UC-SUB-G-02 提交并答复群众建议" as G02
  usecase "UC-SUB-G-03 限时办结并公示结果" as G03
}

CONSUMER --> G01
CONSUMER --> G02
GOV --> G01
GOV --> G02
GOV --> G03
REGU --> G03

note bottom of G01
  12345 不可接，工单体系自建+线下流转
end note
note bottom of G03
  承接投诉升级（UC-SUB-D-02 未解决时）
end note
@enduml
